      "elf"
    ],
    "class_level": 2,
    "class_level_note": "The Muse Elf's alone: OpenMU's elfClassLevel 2, as the Divine set's (docs/second-class-gear.md).",
    "skill": 24
  },
  "stance": "bow",
  "stance_from": "CharacterManager.cpp:72 counts MODEL_CELESTIAL_BOW with the bows, so PLAYER_STOP_BOW 8 and PLAYER_WALK_BOW 21.",
  "two_handed": true,
  "fires": "Arrow01",
  "fires_from": "ZzzEffectMagicSkill.cpp:245: `case MODEL_CELESTIAL_BOW: CreateEffect(MODEL_ARROW_HOLY, ...)`. Not built: the missiles are an arrow and a bolt (the user, 2026-10-03), so the wooden arrow, which Arrows::modelFor gives number 17 by name.",
  "sheets": {
    "Ebow4": "ebow4.png",
    "Ebow_R": "ebow_r.png",
    "bow01": "bow01.png",
    "bow05": "bow05.tga.png"
  },
  "sheet_from": "Data/Item/Ebow4.OZJ (64x128: silver limbs lacquered magenta, gold marks) and Ebow_R.OZJ (32x16, a pink gradient), decoded from MuMain with pipeline/decode_texture.py; bow01.OZJ (the nocked arrow) and bow05.ozt (the string card) were already in the tree. The .bmd names Ebow4.jpg on 712 triangles, Ebow_R.jpg on 8, bow01.jpg on 10 and bow05.tga on 3.",
  "material_note": "By island, sorted against the .obj's groups (UV and length ranges): 0-3 the nocked arrow on bow01 (10 tris, wood), 4-5 the string card on bow05.tga (3, cloth), 88-91 Ebow_R (8) and the rest Ebow4 (712), both painted_steel: Ebow4 paints its own highlights down the silver limbs, MU's metal as MU drew it, and the magenta is lacquer as on the Divine set it goes with.",
  "cutout": [
    "bow05"
  ],
  "cutout_note": "Declared, as the Tiger Bow's: bow05.tga is a cut-out card, and without it the string renders as a grey rectangle.",
  "glint_note": "Not built, a client effect as the Tiger Bow's: held, MU puts BITMAP_SHINY+1 on bones 13-18 and 5-8, lit (0.5, 0.5, 0.8) times a flickering 0.35-0.5 (ZzzCharacter.cpp:7045-7052), a pale blue glint at the limb tips.",
  "release": 0.667,
  "release_from": "Key 4 of this rig's six, as the Chaos Nature Bow's: Bone10 (bone 17 here), the arrow's root, runs -46.6, -23.4, -8.2, +4.4 and then -54.5 on key 4. 4/6.",
  "muzzle_bone": "Bone10",
  "muzzle_axis": "Bone11",
  "muzzle_offset": [
    1.0,
    -10.7,
    0.3
  ],
  "muzzle_from": "The Chaos Nature Bow's, measured: Bone10 at (0, -6.173, -46.594) with no parent and Bone11 at (0, 0.3, 64.8) off it, the same nocked arrow on bow01. The same nineteen-bone rig.",
  "glow": {
    "Ebow_R": {}
  },
  "glow_note": "Mesh 3, Ebow_R, is drawn added by MU's texture-name script: a sheet named <name>_R is m_bBright (TextureScript.cpp:16-70), and RenderBody makes such a mesh its own BlendMesh (ZzzBMD.cpp:2236-2242) at the body's light. Steady: no ItemObjectAttribute pulse names it. Baked as painted_steel until 2026-10-10, as every _R sheet the pipeline did not read.",
